  "_aurum": "THE AURUM KOMPRESSOR. The end of the campaign, and deliberately not an upgrade. It is a pump: one shot per manual cycle, a twelve-round hopper, the flattest arc in the game and the highest payout multiplier on the field. Every marker is a sidegrade and this one is no exception -- it is the hardest thing here to use. That is the reward. An aim trainer whose ultimate item made you shoot better would have no reason to exist, so the ultimate item is a statement that you do not need one.",
